### Works in VS Code (REST Client extension) and IntelliJ. Set the host once:
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Register (first run only)
# @name register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "password": "a-long-password", "name": "Manoj" }

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "you@example.com", "password": "a-long-password" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Create the 9 PM Bath reminder (repeats every day)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bath", "date": "2026-11-10", "time": "21:00", "category": "Health", "repeat": "daily" }

### List tasks
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tick a task for a day (replace the id)
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/REPLACE_WITH_TASK_ID/toggle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-11-10" }

### Targets
POST {{host}}/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "FINAL", "title": "Get placed at a product company", "target": 100, "deadline": "2027-06-30" }

### Send a test notification to every channel you set up
POST {{host}}/api/notifications/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Everything in one call
GET {{host}}/api/state
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
